# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Boss, 0.8.11: "Now I am seeing double icons... and then I tried to do tap backs on other messages, and some of them did not even register."
# Isolated DEMO fixtures only, behind tools/walkthrough/messages-own-handle-proxy.py: the Mac names his reactions by another of his
# handles, fromMe false, as the live service did. INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN, INJECT_DEMO_HOST, INJECT_DEMO_PORT.
fold folded
wait 1200
shell cmd statusbar collapse
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2FINJECT_DEMO_HOST%3AINJECT_DEMO_PORT&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
tap Link
wait 20000
expect Ana Demo
tap Ana Demo
wait 1500
expect Perfect, see you there
# His first, then a switch to another: one chip for him the whole way.
clearlog
doubletap Perfect, see you there
tap Tapback laugh
log tapback shown me:laugh
wait 1500
doubletap Perfect, see you there
tap Tapback emphasize
log tapback shown me:emphasize
wait 2000
# Reopening fetches the Mac's copy, which names him by the other handle.
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
nolog tapback doubled
nolog tapback left
shot switched-one-chip card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# Fast across other messages: each tap leaves its reaction, and none is shown twice.
clearlog
doubletap Are we still on for dinner?
tap Tapback love
doubletap Yes! 7pm
tap Tapback like
doubletap Edit this demo message
tap Tapback question
log tapback shown me:love
log tapback shown me:like
log tapback shown me:question
wait 2000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
nolog tapback doubled
nolog tapback left
shot fast-across-messages card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# A second tap on his own takes it off, because it is known as his.
clearlog
doubletap Yes! 7pm
tap Tapback like
log tapback left
wait 2000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
nolog tapback shown
nolog tapback doubled
shot taken-off card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
